@startuml
' Documentation owner: IT26101135
' Names verified against Java source; method parameter lists intentionally hidden.
title IT26101135 — authentication and students
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
abstract class User {
  -String id
  -String name
  -String email
  -String passwordHash
  -AccountStatus status
  +Role getRole()
  +String getDashboardPath()
  +void setEmail()
}
note right of User
Encapsulation: private account fields and validating setters. Abstract role/dashboard methods are overridden.
end note
class Student {
  -String phone
  -String activePackageId
  -String activeEnrollmentId
  -int lessonsRemaining
  +Role getRole()
  +String getDashboardPath()
}
note right of Student
Inheritance: Student extends User. Polymorphism: its own role and dashboard.
end note
class AuthController {
  -AuthService authService
  -AuthSessionService authSessionService
  +String register()
  +String login()
  +String logout()
}
note right of AuthController
CREATE register; READ/login uses account credentials. Password is not returned to the page.
end note
class AuthService {
  -UserRepository userRepository
  -PasswordHasher passwordHasher
  +Student registerStudent()
  +Optional<User> authenticate()
}
note right of AuthService
CREATE registerStudent: new students are ACTIVE. READ authenticate: compares a hash.
end note
class AuthSessionService {
  -AuthService authService
  -UserRepository userRepository
  +LoginResult loginWithResult()
  +Optional<User> getCurrentUser()
  +User requireLogin()
  +User requireAdmin()
  +void logout()
}
class UserRepository {
  -EnrollmentRepository enrollments
  +void save()
  +List<User> readAllStrict()
  +Optional<User> findByIdStrict()
  +void update()
  +void delete()
}
note right of UserRepository
Extends FileRepository<User> (shared figure). Storage CRUD; unpaid lesson balances are cleared on reads.
end note
interface StudentProfiles {
  +StudentProfile getOwnProfile()
  +StudentProfile updateOwnProfile()
}
note right of StudentProfiles
Abstraction / I: a small profile contract.
end note
class StudentProfileService {
  -UserRepository userRepository
  -AuthSessionService authSessionService
  +StudentProfile getOwnProfile()
  +StudentProfile updateOwnProfile()
}
note right of StudentProfileService
READ/UPDATE own profile only. Duplicate/storage errors and HTTP ownership errors are shared; model setters validate details.
end note
class StudentProfileController {
  -StudentProfiles profileService
  +String showProfile()
  +String showEdit()
  +String updateProfile()
}
note right of StudentProfileController
D: constructor receives StudentProfiles, not its concrete implementation.
end note
class StudentAccountService {
  -AuthSessionService auth
  -UserRepository users
  +void deleteOwnAccount()
}
note right of StudentAccountService
DELETE account after linked-record checks. Controller is in the omission index.
end note
Student --|> User
AuthController ..> AuthService
AuthController ..> AuthSessionService
AuthSessionService ..> AuthService
AuthService ..> UserRepository
AuthSessionService ..> UserRepository
UserRepository --> User : stores
AuthService ..> Student : creates
StudentProfileService ..|> StudentProfiles
StudentProfileController ..> StudentProfiles
StudentProfileService ..> UserRepository
StudentProfileService ..> AuthSessionService
StudentAccountService ..> UserRepository
@enduml

